2026-09-29 17:50 Done. Cause: Config::from_env and generate_config wrote default: {engine: OpenAI} without api_key_env (models: entries already had it), so the default engine read only LANGERTHA_OPENAI_API_KEY and croaked with OPENAI_API_KEY. Fix: both set api_key_env to the variable scan_env found (Config.pm). Only OpenAI is ever made default, other engines' entries already carried api_key_env. Test t/92_default_engine_key_env.t (each of the three OpenAI vars: default names it, Router builds the default engine with that key, for from_env and generated YAML) — red before (croak), green after; t/10-config.t green. Docs: README (default engine / generated config), Config from_env POD, Init POD.

